<title>CHINA: China expels S.Koreans for religious activities.</title>
<headline>China expels S.Koreans for religious activities.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has ordered three South Koreans to leave the country after they conducted illegal religious activities, the Hong Kong-based semi-official China News Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The three were found to be members of a Korean religious organisation who had carried out illegal religious activities in China's biggest city Shanghai, including recruiting members and agents for spreading their religion, it said.</p>
<p>The Koreans admitted the activities, it said, without giving any further details.</p>
